yntax in commit bodies\n\nThis ensures all generated and suggested commits follow standard course practices.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":6,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"c955ee4dd2afe3b4c04497aca762056b86f985ac","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-MoreOOP\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"c5cdf7f9bbf1ee7784df76793c26befe94ce6fc7","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Organize classes into bob package structure","messageBody":"Classes previously resided in the default root package and mixed plural/singular package names.\n\nLet\u0027s:\n* move all source files under the bob base package\n* standardize subpackage names to singular (command, exception, task)\n* update all package declarations and import paths\n* configure VS Code Java sourcePaths in .vscode/settings.json\n\nThis establishes a consistent namespace hierarchy and follows standard Java package naming conventions.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":234,"deletions":138}}},{"hash":"f779cfb2c86a99de29f2b7735413278c98c42e03","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Rename IStorage to Storage and remove ExitException","messageBody":"IStorage used a Hungarian notation \u0027I\u0027 prefix contrary to Java naming conventions, and ExitException is no longer needed after refactoring exit flow to Command.isExit().\n\nLet\u0027s:\n* rename IStorage interface to Storage\n* update TaskStorage to implement Storage\u003cTaskList\u003e\n* delete unused ExitException class\n\nThis cleans up obsolete types and aligns interface naming with standard Java conventions.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":2,"deletions":18}}},{"hash":"f6b66c0dbb7682e76f7feb4ac8b8a4eb8bf30f34","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-Packages\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Packages"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"ShengHaozz":{"java":975,"md":8